<title>BANGLADESH: Ten Bangladeshis die in bus crash.</title>
<headline>Ten Bangladeshis die in bus crash.</headline>
<dateline>CHITTAGONG, Bangladesh 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 10 people were killed and 60 injured when their bus skidded off the road and overturned on Chittagong-Ramgarh highway on Thursday, police said.</p>
<p>The police said the bus was overcrowded and travelling with poor visibility due to fog.</p>
